              "text": "If an injury occurs, all games on the field will halt until the player(s) can be removed as soon as safety\ndictates. If an injury occurs that requires play stoppage in the last three minutes of a game and the score\nis within one touchdown, the referee will stop the clock and keep the remaining time in the game."
